<html>
<body style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">
  <p>Hello Escalation Team,</p>
  <p>The following case has been escalated and requires immediate attention:</p>
  <table style="border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 4px 8px; background: #f3f3f3;"><b>Case</b></td>
      <td style="padding: 4px 8px;"><a href="{!Case.Link}">{!Case.CaseNumber}</a></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 4px 8px; background: #f3f3f3;"><b>Subject</b></td>
      <td style="padding: 4px 8px;">{!Case.Subject}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 4px 8px; background: #f3f3f3;"><b>Priority</b></td>
      <td style="padding: 4px 8px;">{!Case.Priority}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 4px 8px; background: #f3f3f3;"><b>Status</b></td>
      <td style="padding: 4px 8px;">{!Case.Status}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 4px 8px; background: #f3f3f3;"><b>Account</b></td>
      <td style="padding: 4px 8px;">{!Case.Account.Name}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 4px 8px; background: #f3f3f3;"><b>Owner</b></td>
      <td style="padding: 4px 8px;">{!Case.Owner.Name}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <p>Please triage this escalation and assign a senior owner if needed.</p>
  <p>Thank you,<br/>Service Cloud Support</p>
</body>
</html>